  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Disaster Risk Management  in Timor-Leste</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to assist the Government of Timor-Leste to enhance disaster risk management at national, municipal and local levels. In order to achieve this, the project supports the decentralization of Timor-Leste&#x2019;s disaster management system, taking into account the roles and responsibilities of national, municipal and local actors for effective and efficient disaster prevention, preparedness, response, and recovery activities.</narrative>
  </description>
